  "description": "Eun-Chae is a singer who hides her true identity from the public using all kinds of tricks. One day, she crosses paths with Do-Hyuk, a handsome company director who seems determined to make her confess her secret. The reason? Do-Hyuk wants to know why his father is suddenly interested in an indie rock band he'd never heard of before. What will become of Eun-Chae's secret?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
